[/uid] (2026-08-27 11:04):[/b]<br/><br/>妈妈啵啵[s:ac:吻][s:ac:吻][s:ac:吻][s:ac:吻][s:ac:吻][/quote]<br/><br/>必须给你点个赞，就得这么叫，狼头听了肯定心里暖暖的[s:ac:赞同]", "lou": 161, "content_length": 53, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 879768890, "postdatetimestamp": 1787799952}, {"pid": 879770263, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 0, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-27 11:12", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "[E1787800388 0 0]\t", "content": "[quote][pid=879769687,47288722,1587]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=39300377]陳熊貓[/uid] (2026-08-27 11:08):[/b]<br/><br/>兔佬，8月5-7日算不算红三兵啊？我看好像也是啊……[/quote]<br/><br/>算啊，所以第四天直接跳空光头阳加速<br/><br/>至于后面坠机了，那是后面的事[s:ac:哭笑]", "lou": 162, "content_length": 65, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 879769687, "postdatetimestamp": 1787800345}, {"pid": 879771430, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 60, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-27 11:19", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "我今天特别想来一句:“散户会卖在第一根大阳k”<br/><br/>但是我每次开香槟装b后面都是坠机，所以今天我还真不敢奶这一口[s:ac:哭笑]没把握啊，兄弟们，先把钱赚了，面子后面再补", "lou": 163, "content_length": 143, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787800778}, {"pid": 879786708, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 34, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-27 13:24", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "科技不新高，指数就不会新高，归根结底动能最足的只有科技<br/><br/>应该不是走成下午出货的样子吧？也太他妈丑了，演一天都演不了，真这么走以后大伙是真不愿意和你们玩了，太脏了，关键是也没什么砸盘理由啊，就是涨了就砸？", "lou": 164, "content_length": 200, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787808247}, {"pid": 879786868, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 29, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-27 13:25", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "这一波券商拉升，科技跟着动，就有了，科技借着出货，那我真不知道还要什么利好才能刺激市场，那只能转头向下寻找利好了", "lou": 165, "content_length": 112, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787808337}, {"pid": 879788134, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 40, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-27 13:38", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "太失望了我草[s:ac:嘲笑1]别告诉我就是一直科技阴跌出货然后再拉个尾盘，资金悄咪咪跑去什么种子猪猪医药，玩他们那个拙劣的高低切游戏，当我们是傻的啊，真这么玩明天证转银了", "lou": 166, "content_length": 150, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787809116}, {"pid": 879790094, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 43, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-27 13:55", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "幽灵，有一个无形的幽灵飘荡在大A市场的上空", "lou": 167, "content_length": 41, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787810159}, {"pid": 879791015, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 8192, "score": 18, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-27 14:03", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "[E1787810778 0 0]\t", "content": "迟钝的群众还在关注大哥二哥，敏锐的鹰隼已经买入哈药股份<br/><br/>[s:a2:doge]加个狗头怕有小白真信了<br/><br/>[img]./mon_202608/27/axyfQ56-e6rgK17T3cSsg-jq.jpg[/img]", "lou": 168, "content_length": 114, "attachs": [{"attachurl": "mon_202608/27/axyfQ56-e6rgK17T3cSsg-jq.jpg", "size": 43, "type": "img", "subid": 0, "url_utf8_org_name": "temp0628250IMG_20260827_140335.png", "dscp": "", "path": "mon_202608/27", "name": "axyfQ56-e6rgK17T3cSsg-jq.jpg", "ext": "jpg", "thumb": "120", "hash": ""}], "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787810632}, {"pid": 879795281, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 28, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-27 14:40", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "今天做成光头红三兵，场外买盘涌入不是很正常吗[s:ac:茶]抢鸡蛋好啊，都来抢，鸡蛋管够", "lou": 169, "content_length": 70, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787812830}, {"pid": 879796508, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 46, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-27 14:50", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "放量大阳突破均线压制，这里怎么也不至于看空吧，你们不能玩技术把自己玩进去了，什么时候出负反馈了再谈走，现在看空纯粹自己和自己博弈", "lou": 170, "content_length": 128, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787813419}, {"pid": 879797854, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 6, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-27 15:00", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879796959,47288722,1622]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=38090976]sora496[/uid] (2026-08-27 14:53):[/b]<br/><br/>仓位决定屁股，我有仓位我肯定是要卖一点，越靠近4000越卖[/quote]<br/><br/>明天收天线被ma60反压我就跑路", "lou": 171, "content_length": 33, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 879796959, "postdatetimestamp": 1787814056}, {"pid": 879845304, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 5, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-27 23:08", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "[E1787843303 0 0]\t", "content": "一眼没看怎么美股涨成这个b样了，大a能不能学学", "lou": 172, "content_length": 44, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787843286}, {"pid": 879845575, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 14, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-27 23:11", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879845426,47288722,1644]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=39700287]PoW[/uid] (2026-08-27 23:09):[/b]<br/><br/>[s:ac:哭笑]兔佬你这一天一个样真不怕精分吗[/quote]<br/><br/>模式要成长，思路要多变，人格要复杂[s:ng:呲牙笑]", "lou": 173, "content_length": 37, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 879845426, "postdatetimestamp": 1787843485}, {"pid": 879848476, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 1, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-27 23:48", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[b]Reply to [pid=879846736,47288722,1644]Reply[/pid] Post by [uid=67274442]Elmo002[/uid] (2026-08-27 23:25)[/b]哎，真科技还是太高贵了[s:ac:冷]什么时候我们的国产替代企业能达到这个水平，差不多就要被当成路边一条和光伏新能源坐一桌吃饭了", "lou": 174, "content_length": 140, "reply_to": 879846736, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787845692}, {"pid": 879849676, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 1, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 00:04", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[b]Reply to [pid=879849346,47288722,1645]Reply[/pid] Post by [uid=67165063]熊猫射手[/uid] (2026-08-28 00:00)[/b]有没有可能是在给美股续命呢，毕竟A股走个什么下跌大浪都无所谓一样，美股敢走个下跌大浪试试看，反正明天早上睡醒了就知道结果啦，今天翻了一晚上研报资料，眼睛都看花了，比上班都累", "lou": 175, "content_length": 202, "reply_to": 879849346, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787846655}, {"pid": 879849844, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 0, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 00:06", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[b]Reply to [pid=879849583,47288722,1646]Reply[/pid] Post by [uid=67274442]Elmo002[/uid] (2026-08-28 00:03)[/b]这个思路角度对我来说还蛮新的，学习了，如果从这个角度理解，FCC是不是也就是一个纯造牌的噱头，因为不可能动不动就封死一个产业链的高价值环节，如果频繁这样操作，最终只会反噬自己", "lou": 176, "content_length": 201, "reply_to": 879849583, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787846779}, {"pid": 879868585, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 25, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 09:06", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "claude说，对于大A，我不关心，也不理解，但是你不能把这笔钱给她", "lou": 177, "content_length": 61, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787879164}, {"pid": 879868838, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 52, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 09:08", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "感觉自从涛涛那次开始，我比较熟悉的一批人就屡屡开始爆出莫名其妙的花边新闻，cn资本操盘手们还是太压抑了，年轻的时候苦坏了，看到孙割都天天喊妈妈，我对你们这帮人也释怀了", "lou": 178, "content_length": 164, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787879296}, {"pid": 879870755, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 18, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-28 09:23", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "透景一字我是真绷不住了[s:ac:哭笑]搞子太多了，之前九阳顶板那次我现在还记得", "lou